# ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# CRITICAL: NEVER COMMIT THESE
# ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# Your Solana private key + Helius API key live here. Committing this
# file = wallet drained + paid API key abused by anyone who finds the
# repo. Even private repos can leak. Just never commit it.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Telethon session files — contain Telegram auth tokens. Anyone with
# these can impersonate the bot/user session on Telegram.
*.session
*.session-journal

